\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   verschiedene Eintr\u228 \'e4ge (Lombardei, 15. Jh.). 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Psalter}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (sog. diakritische Rezension, Mail\u228 \'e4nder Version). 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Prolog. 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Sophronius Eusebius Hieronymus, Versiculi. 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Psalmen. 200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Cantica prophetarum. 210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   ambrosianische Hymnen. 231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Athanasius Alexandrinus, Expositio catholicae fidei. 236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat.}

