ain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De concordia praescientiae et praedestinationis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Ps.-Hieronymus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De essentia divinitatis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   sp\u228 \'e4teres Inhaltsverzeichnis.  }

