\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   R\u246 \'f6merbrief. 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Korintherbriefe. 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Galaterbrief. 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Epheserbrief. 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Philipperbrief. 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Kolosserbrief. 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Thessalonikerbriefe. 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Timotheusbriefe. 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Titusbrief. 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Philemonbrief. 128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Hebr\u228 \'e4erbrief. 150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Schlusskommentar.}

