\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt: I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Vorspann: Prologe und Exzerpte (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Per ipsum est tibi omnis honor quia omnis creatura [\u8230 \'85]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; wie bei Paulusbriefen in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Clm 4565}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Glauche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   1994, S. 103). 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   R\u246 \'f6merbrief. 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Korintherbriefe. 92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Galaterbrief. 104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Epheserbrief. 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Philipperbrief. 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Kolosserbrief. 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Thessalonikerbriefe. 143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Timotheusbriefe. 157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Titusbrief. 161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Philemonbrief. 162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Hebr\u228 \'e4erbrief.}

