\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt: 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Praefatio und Prolog (sp\u228 \'e4tere Zutat). 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   R\u246 \'f6merbrief. 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Korintherbriefe. 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Galaterbrief. 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Epheserbrief. 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Philipperbrief. 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Kolosserbrief. 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Thessalonikerbriefe. 126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Timotheusbriefe. 141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Titusbrief. 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Philemonbrief (sp\u228 \'e4tere Zutat). 146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Hebr\u228 \'e4erbrief. }

