[0].6524/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Mitte 16. Jh.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\u228 \'e4hnlich {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://6560[0].6770/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Piccard, Frucht, I 916\endash 945}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). }

