\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Im Jahr 1314 erg\u228 \'e4nzte der Kopist {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Stephanus de Govtana}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?) die j\u252 \'fcngere Glosse (Bl. 252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   der Glosse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno domini m\u176 \'b0ccc\u176 \'b0quatuordecimo die dominica [...] Stephanus de Govtana [?] finivit istum apparatum. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezsoz[1].4600/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 M\u252 \'fcnchen, Hofbibliothek}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (auf vorderem Spiegel {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://6560[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Exlibris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://6560[0].6770/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Dressler B3aa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 1630). }

