{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Liber Almansoris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Synonyma}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Liber divisionum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[6].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Antidotarium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   diverse Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge (z.B. Rezepte). }

