\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Inhalts\u252 \'fcbersicht.\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardus de Gordonio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lilium medicinae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Teil 1; 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Teil 2; 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Teil 3; 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Teil 4; 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Teil 5; 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Teil 6; 99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Teil 7). 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   f\u252 \'fcnf Schreibernachs\u228 \'e4tze (darunter: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Scriptus fuit liber iste in crastino beate lucie virginis. Anno domini m\u176 \'b0.ccc.xiii\u176 \'b0}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); sp\u228 \'e4tere Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen (Ende 14. Jh.). 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat (Kleisterreste, einst als Spiegel verklebt).}

