\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Bl. I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   autographe Erl\u228 \'e4uterungen von Hartmann Schedel zum Kauf der Handschrift, 1503. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Galenus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Opera}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (in lateinischer \u220 \'dcbersetzung): 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De elementis. 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De farmaciis. 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De haeresibus. 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De sectis medicorum. 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De accidenti et morbo libri VI. 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  De regimine sanitatis. 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De interioribus libri VI. 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De febribus. 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De complexionibus libri III. 143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De malitia complexionis. 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De crisi. 168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De criticis diebus. 181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De optima corporis nostri compositione. 183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De virtutibus alimentorum. 202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De virtutibus naturalibus libri X. 243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Introductio ad pulsuum doctrinam. 247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Compendium pulsuum. 248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De tabe sive marasmo. 251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De voce. 253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De causis pulsus.}

