\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\cbpat8\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Rubrikenverzeichnis von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand. 1a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Iustinianus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   imperator, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Infortiatum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Buch XXIV\endash XXXVIII) mit Glossen des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Accursius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 1a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXIV. 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXV. 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXVI. 33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXVII. 49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXVIII. 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXIX. 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXX. 104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXXI. 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXXII. 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXXIII. 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXXIV. 167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXXV. 185a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Tres partes. 189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXXVI. 211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXXVII. 231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXXVIII. 254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   nachtr\u228 \'e4gliches Verzeichnis der einzelnen B\u252 \'fccher. 254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Epitaphium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   des sienesischen Kardinals {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Francesco de\rquote  Piccolomini}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (sp\u228 \'e4ter Papst Pius III.) auf seinen 1464 verstorbenen Onkel, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Papst Pius II.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Enea Silvio de\rqu