\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 297\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Guido de Baisio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Rosarium super Decretum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Concordantia discordantium canonum; distinctiones. 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Causae I-XXXIV. 261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 262\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De penitentia. 276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Causae XXXV-XXXVI. 281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 297\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   De consecratione). 297a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Inhalts\u252 \'fcbersicht mit Folio-Angaben, 17. Jh. 297a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 298\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant.  }

