per\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Oratio dicenda ante inchoationem missae. 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Convivium [agni] pauperis Christi crucifixi. 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Clemens IV.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Papa, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[10].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dolores virginis Mariae in passione unigeniti filii}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Orationes. 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Verba virginis Mariae ad crucem. 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Carmen. 125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Exzerpte ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[5].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hieronymus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[6].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Isidorus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Thomas de Aquino). 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Libet in fine opusculi interrogare eos qui patrimonia sua inaurant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
