INK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Constitutiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (= Anhang von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand, nach 1336; endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Data Avinionj quarto kli. Febr. pontificatus nostri anno secundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 320\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 321\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 322\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes de Deo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentum arboris de consanguinitate et affin}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  itate. 322\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   diverse Eintr\u228 \'e4ge und dilettantische Skizze eines Arbor affinitatis in brauner Tinte, daneben Datum 1475: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Anno domini m\u176 \'b0cccc\u176 \'b0lxxv\u176 \'b0 [...]}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . }

