\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Guilelmus Varignana}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Practica medicinae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Rezepte f\u252 \'fcr Medikamente. 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Rasis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Muhammad \plain \f2\fs24 R\u257 \'e2z\u299 \'ee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Synonyma}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat (Rasur). 80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Zahlentabelle f\u252 \'fcr die Monate der Jahre 1285-1316 (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   weitgehend getilgt). 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   langer, schlecht erhaltener Eintrag (theologisch?) einer sp\u228 \'e4teren Hand. 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Rasis, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Liber divisionum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Ende unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig). 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Idem, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Liber Almansoris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

