\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Kapitel\u252 \'fcbersicht f\u252 \'fcr alle 4 B\u252 \'fccher (Nachtrag einer sp\u228 \'e4teren Hand). 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Damascenus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De orthodoxa fide}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch 1; 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch 2; 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch 3; 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch 4).}

